      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../GeoResults.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>GeoResults</code></a> instance manually calculating the average distance in the given <a href=\"../Metric.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Metric</code></a>\nfrom the distance values of the given <a href=\"../GeoResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>GeoResult</code></a>s.",
